We also need to assign operator_resource, skill_certificate, compliance_certificate, equipment_resource.

We have single operator (driver_operator_alpha), single skill_certificate_alpha, single compliance_certificate_alpha, two equipment resources (alpha, beta). We need to link each candidate appropriately.

Thus we need to schedule resource usage sequentially.

